;; Ported from OCaml 5.5.0 (the release tarball, SHA-256 fcc6ae665d1ec51d52510eaac7834a86a9806bf5a258bb7cca78733fccf015ba):
;; lambda/simplif.ml (eliminate_ref, simplify_exits, simplify_lets, simplify_local_functions, simplify_lambda) and of
;; lambda/lambda.ml the traversals it calls (free_variables, subst and rename, shallow_iter, shallow_map,
;; find_exact_application), whose notice follows (LICENSE.md, "The OCaml Core System"):
;;
;;                                 OCaml
;;
;;             Xavier Leroy, projet Cristal, INRIA Rocquencourt
;;
